\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore MAS/IDR Link -2: Investors More Discerning \b0\par\par\uc2 345 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 2000\par 06:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- There is no fundamental link between the levels of the Singapore dollar and the Indonesian rupiah, even though both \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  tend to move in tandem, a senior official of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore said Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "We don't see any fundamental reason why that should be the case," Khor Hoe Ee, senior executive director for economics, said of the parallel movements of the two \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Because of Singapore's trade and investment links with other countries in southeast Asia, "It's natural that when investors look at Singapore they also look closely at what happens in the region," he added. \par \par \uc2  But he said that fundamentally, "Indonesia is doing well," despite the recent steep decline in the Indonesian rupiah. \par \par \uc2  He said investors are starting to separate economic fundamentals from market sentiment. "Investors are much more discerning than they have been before," he said. "They will make a distinction between what happens in the financial markets and what happens in the real economy." \par \par \uc2  Observers have been surprised by the sensitivity of the Singapore dollar to movements in the rupiah, saying that the economic links between the two countries aren't particularly strong. \par \par \uc2  The two countries don't compete for the same export markets, and Singapore investment in Indonesia has been modest. Singapore investments in Indonesia in 1997 came to just US$3.1 billion, less than 10% of the total USR$36 billion of outward investment. \par \par \uc2  MAS officials declined to discuss whether the MAS had responded to a recent appeal by the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for help in shoring up the level of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  However, MAS Managing Director Koh Yong Guan tacitly acknowledged that the MAS had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent weeks to shore up the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar. \par \par \uc2  "It's no secret that we \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market from time to time when speculation and speculative elements bring the Singapore dollar out of line," he said. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-421-4802; christopher.wellisz@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7r03nk2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
