\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Tracks Regional  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Higher Early \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 2000\par 04:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar is higher early Thursday, tracking a stronger Indonesian rupiah and Thai baht, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0225 GMT (10:25 p.m. EDT Wednesday), the U.S. dollar was trading at S$1.7418, down from S$1.7446 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  drifted lower in overnight trading in New York as banks unwound long U.S. dollar positions after consistent selling by Singapore banks in Asia Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Selling of U.S. dollars for the baht and rupiah early Thursday also inspired market participants to sell it for Singapore dollars, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  However, the U.S. dollar is expected to be well supported by buying interest around S$1.7400-S$1.7405, with fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , capping it around S$1.7450. \par \par \uc2  "Yesterday we saw local banks selling (U.S. dollars) around S$1.7455-60, which means the MAS doesn't want to see it above S$1.7450," a European dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers reported good two way interest in buying and selling U.S. dollars for Singapore dollars and expect active trading within a narrow range. \par \par \uc2  The last suspected MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred late Monday after the U.S. dollar hit a 22-month high of S$1.7515. \par \par \uc2  -By Amit Prakash, Dow Jones Newswires; (+65) 421-4809; amit.prakash@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7r03ng2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
