\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Falls To 22-Mo Low As MAS Stays Away \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juli 2000\par 05:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- Stop-loss U.S. dollar buying pushed the Singapore dollar to a 22-month low early Tuesday, with no signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Around 0245 GMT (10:45 p.m. EDT Monday), the U.S. dollar was trading at S$1.7411, up from S$1.7373 late Monday in Asia. The last time the U.S. dollar was trading above S$1.7400 was September 10, 1998. \par \par \uc2  "Stop losses took (the U.S. dollar) above S$1.7400 and it is still looking bid," a U.S. bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Having broken the S$1.7400 resistance, market participants are cautiously testing levels above it in the absence of any significant upward momentum for the U.S. dollar from weaknesses in the Indonesian rupiah and the Thai baht, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as yet. \par \par \uc2  "Right now the market is testing levels above S$1.7400, but I don't think (MAS) is going to come in at these levels," a European bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  MAS "appears to want to defend the big numbers. I don't think (MAS) will come in unless S$1.7500 is threatened," he added. \par \par \uc2  Barring MAS \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the U.S. dollar is expected to trade in a S$1.7375 to S$1.7425 range Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By Amit Prakash, Dow Jones Newswires; (+65) 421-4809; amit.prakash@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw7b03d6l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
