\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Dlr Up Late On Fears Of MAS  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 2000\par 12:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  -(Dow Jones)- The \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar has strengthened late Friday on position-squaring ahead of the weekend and on fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Around 1013 GMT, the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7325, down from S$1.7355 late Thursday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Short-covering by offshore funds and corporate interest in U.S. dollars had bolstered the U.S. dollar to an intraday high of S$1.7363 in early trading, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But unverified rumors of possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  back down to as low as S$1.7311, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely be hemmed in around S$1.7280 to S$1.7380 in the short term, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The yen's resilience overnight has also, to a lesser extent, exerted some downward pressure on the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  vis-a-vis the Singapore dollar, dealers said. The dollar had broken below the key Y105 level overnight, and was trading at Y104.43 late in the day. \par \par \uc2  -By Netty Ismail, Dow Jones Newswires; 65-421-4807; netty.ismail@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw6n0330h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\p