\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Slightly Weaker Late In Quiet Range Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2000\par 11:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar is slightly weaker against its U.S. counterpart, reflecting weakness on other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in quiet, range-bound trading on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT, the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7345, up from S$1.7336 late Monday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Although the Singapore dollar weakened slightly, it remained well within its recent trading range, showing that it has managed to insulate itself from wild swings in other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  like the peso and rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  With the U.S. dollar stable against the yen and weakening slightly against the euro, traders are no longer convinced it will continue to rise against the Singapore dollar, one said. \par \par \uc2  In addition, the market is unwilling to push the U.S. dollar higher against the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar for fear of provoking \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , one dealer added, even though there have been no recent reports of the MAS checking prices. \par \par \uc2  However, some dealers say the Singapore dollar could remain sensitive to strong movements in the rupiah, which has been weakened by reports of sectarian violence in Indonesia and doubts about the direction of economic reform. \par \par \uc2  If the U.S. dollar moves above IDR8,800, "The pressure will be on the Sing," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  But barring any major turbulence in Indonesia, most dealers say the U.S. dollar is likely to continue trading in its recent range of S$1.7300 to S$1.7350. \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 65/ 421-4802; christopher.wellisz@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5u02ogx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
