\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Ends Higher On Long US Dlr Liquidation \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2000\par 10:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE -(Dow Jones)- The Singapore dollar ended stronger Thursday as participants liquidated long U.S. dollar positions to reap profits, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar moved in tandem with the Thai baht and the Indonesian rupiah, which also gained Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT (4:50 a.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar was at S$1.7327, down from S$1.7358 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Share prices in Singapore and elsewhere in the region also stabilized after several days of sharp losses, lending support to Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said support from the Singapore stock market is likely to be short-lived. "The stock market isn't attracting any foreign interest," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  In addition, dealers said, the Singapore dollar will likely suffer from low local interest rates, which make long Singapore dollar positions unappealing. \par \par \uc2  Dealers predicted that the U.S. dollar could fall as low as S$1.7300 Friday before rising again. "At S$1.7300 I would expect to see some keen buyers" of the U.S. dollar, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Fear of provoking \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on the other hand, should limit the U.S. dollar's gains, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "People are very reticent about buying actively," one said. "They are buying on dips to see what happens." \par \par \uc2  -By Christopher Wellisz; 65/ 421-4802; christopher.wellisz@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5p02m9k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
